      "id": "INIT-HISTORY-01",
      "priority": "P1",
      "status": "resolved",
      "type": "static_control_flow_edge",
      "detail": "Runtime verified history is cleared by Workspace.Load. Controller LoadSource calls Load then RestoreSession even on same frame, so a post-Init EnsureLoaded/Notify/Refresh can discard old >200 proof and block previously permitted Undo. No arbitrary session JSON proof should be trusted.",
      "source": "CManualInspectionWorkspace.Load/_verifiedStoredRevisions.Clear and CManualInspectionController.LoadSource sameFrame Load→RestoreSession",
      "suggestedRegression": "Large existing B -> scoped/all Init save -> EnsureLoaded or external Notify -> Undo/Redo; include changed observation fingerprint so automatic early-return does not hide the branch.",
      "resolution": {
        "source": "Load retains process-local proofs only when Recipe/Run/CoordinateSignature/current Revision and entire fresh actual values/initialized keys exactly match the prior current proof. RestoreSession still filters each proof against actual history. No trusted proof is serialized.",
        "regression": "init_recovery_controller_same_frame_ensureloaded_preserves_verified_large_undo_redo",
        "sourceLinkedResult": "passed in controller-source.json count246",
        "finalActualDllVerification": "deferred to Round 3"
      }
    }
